[{"id": "field:863_161:dec:0xa4a", "jp": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n 目をそらすな…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n 别把视线移开…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "<NAME/>", "dup": "dup:d1980d8ed805"}, {"id": "field:863_161:dec:0xa92", "jp": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n <cb/><c7/>言華はいらない…<c7/>\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n <cb/><c7/>我不需花言巧语…<c7/>\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "<NAME/>", "dup": "dup:8d7573f8d3bc"}, {"id": "field:863_161:dec:0xb16", "jp": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n 貴様…よくも…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n你这家伙…竟敢…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "<NAME/>", "dup": "dup:6865d3d472c4"}, {"id": "field:863_161:dec:0xb3a", "jp": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n 俺を怒らせたな…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n你把我惹火了……\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "<NAME/>", "dup": "dup:1bb2e735eda9"}, {"id": "field:863_161:dec:0xb60", "jp": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n 貴様は殺す…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n我要宰了你……\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "<NAME/>", "dup": "dup:aa244859a9bd"}, {"id": "field:863_161:dec:0xac0", "jp": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n 俺一人で充分だ…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n我一个人就够了……\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "<NAME/>", "dup": "dup:13d929f6f52b"}, {"id": "field:863_161:dec:0x83e", "jp": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n 兄さんとは、ガキの頃よく喧嘩した…\\n 些細な理由ばっかりだった…\\n 向こう側の話だガ…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n小时候，我老跟哥哥打架……\\n每次也都是些鸡毛蒜皮的小事……\\n虽然那是另一边的事……\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "<NAME/>", "dup": "dup:646e69eeedef"}, {"id": "field:863_161:dec:0x8aa", "jp": "<c2e/>克哉<c2e/>\\n そうだったな、思い出したよ…\\n こっちでも、そうだった…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/>克哉<c2e/>\\n是啊，我想起来了……\\n这边也是一样……\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "克哉", "dup": "dup:bd0029e8509b"}, {"id": "field:863_161:dec:0x8fa", "jp": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n 昔、俺ガ熱を出した時、兄さん横で泣いてたな…\\n あんたもそうなのか…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n 以前我发烧的时候，哥哥还在旁边哭过呢……\\n 你也是这样吗……\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "<NAME/>", "dup": "dup:4a05e31a43d5"}, {"id": "field:863_161:dec:0x954", "jp": "<c2e/>克哉<c2e/>\\n どうかな…?\\n そんな昔の事は忘れたよ…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/>克哉<c2e/>\\n 谁知呢…?\\n 那么久以前的事，我早忘了…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "克哉", "dup": "dup:e9c114632969"}, {"id": "field:863_161:dec:0x99a", "jp": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n 子供の日に、柱に傷つけて\\n 兄さんと背比べしたな…\\n <cb/><c7/>こっちの家の柱にも傷はあるか?<c7/>\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/><NAME/><c2e/>\\n儿童节那天，还会在柱子上刻痕\\n和哥哥比身高啊……\\n <cb/><c7/>这边家里的柱子上，也有刻痕吗？<c7/>\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "<NAME/>", "dup": "dup:0f653374f1e6"}, {"id": "field:863_161:dec:0xa0c", "jp": "<c2e/>克哉<c2e/>\\n ああ、残ってる…\\n 残っているともさ…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/>克哉<c2e/>\\n 啊，还留着……\\n 当然还留着……\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "克哉", "dup": "dup:0e902a4509a2"}, {"id": "field:863_161:dec:0xae6", "jp": "<c2e/>克哉<c2e/>\\n あっ… <NAME/>…\\n 待てッ…\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "zh": "<c2e/>克哉<c2e/>\\n 啊… <NAME/>……\\n 等等……\\n<WAIT><PAGE>", "speaker_jp": "克哉", "dup": "dup:5bed2d213c58"}]